OL,3,GNEWSAEverything we know about Torbay
OL,4,AHospital fire risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has been told it must make
OL,7,Fchanges "immediately" to improve its
OL,8,Ffire safety measures following an
OL,9,Finspection in July.
OL,11,FTorbay and South Devon NHS Foundation
OL,12,FTrust was issued an enforcement notice
OL,13,Fby Devon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,14,FService in relation to floors four to
OL,15,Feight of Torbay Hospital's Tower Block.
OL,17,FThe trust said it was "fully committed"
OL,18,Fto meeting the requirements of the
OL,19,Fenforcement notice and was working on
OL,20,F"a plan to temporarily relocate some
OL,21,Fservices based in the Tower Block".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
